    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        1840,
        200
      ],
      "size": [
        340,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 10,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Audio: Load Video's audio goes straight into Video Combine. If an iPhone .mov comes out silent or fails (extra 'apac' spatial-audio track), connect 'iPhone clips: first audio track only' -> Video Combine 'audio' instead (same video selected).\n\nOutline temporal_smooth 0.5 and Estimate smooth 0.6 reduce flicker; Render fixed_dots on removes dot flicker.\n\nSketch outline + dots\n- Sketch Outline: combined = XDoG pencil lines from the frames + silhouettes from the depth. background_fade (needs depth) keeps lines on the people/subject; raise epsilon for fewer lines, sigma for bolder; line_thickness / line_strength for weight.\n- Keep Sketch Outline 'scale' = Stipple Render 'scale' (Combine resizes anyway).\n- Combine 'auto': dark lines multiplied over light dots, light lines screened over dark (dark) renders. line_color e.g. #c03020 paints colored lines. dots_masked_by_lines = lines drawn with dots.\n- The saved name gets the outline settings appended, e.g. ..._combined_ls1_lt1."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
